		<label>combex steel</label>
		<description>An advanced ultratech structural alloy forged by the Combine empire. Combex steel is strong and possesses a distinctive blue hue, but it's heavy and visually unremarkable; Combex steel is built for function, not form.\n\nRoughly 40% plasteel and 60% steel, it is more durable than either, and very cost-efficient for construction. Its resilience to heat makes it ideal for energy-intense weapons, though it has only an average performance when used to create melee weapons and personal armor.</description>
